// RouteRateLimit builds one rate limit descriptor of a request from its actions. Envoy limits the request with the
// descriptor of the `flock.extensions.limit.starling_limit.v1.StarlingRateLimit` of the virtual server holding the
// same entries, from its root down to a descriptor with a policy. A descriptor that matches none of them doesn't limit
// the request.
